		(property "Notes" "Fitted (2026-10-13, dev board and production): clamps Q102 VGS (AGM404AP1 +/-20 V) in a hard PACK_P short until SCD opens the FETs (DSG = VBAT + 10.5-12 V, source near 0 V). Vz 13.8-15.6 V sits above the 10.5-12 V on-state gate drive; leakage at 12 V is tens of nA, which the DSG pump supplies. Required whenever C109 is fitted. Not in TI fig. 9-2"
			(at 241.3 54.61 0)
