		(property "Notes" "4-cell SCP (UL E467707): 15 A rated at 40 C, cut < 1 min at 2x rated, 50 A break, 36 V max, heater operating range 10.5-19.6 V (heater resistance not given; same range as Littelfuse ITV4030L1415, 11.2-20 ohm). Fuse path 1-3 mOhm: about 0.2 W at 10 A. Pin 1 to the cells. Only fuse in the pack path (F101 deleted): 50 A break, below a cell-top dead short (~200 A); faults after Q101/Q102 are cleared by the gauge SCD first Same land pattern as the Littelfuse ITV4030 (pins numbered differently: there fuse 1-3, heater 2)"
			(at 375.92 99.06 0)
